From 8a2b94e4a439cfe4b84032073acb3502c2aabee2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 14:03:25 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Training Grounds: stat tiers cut, Levy Muster and Proving
 Grounds doctrines

- T2 +1 attack damage and T3 +4 HP removed; stance slots and AP steps kept
- T3 doctrine, chartered at the Grand Hall:
  Levy Muster: a martial whose weapon has no maneuvers drills Brace;
  garrison militia after 2 moons instead of 3
  Proving Grounds: carry a second weapon (Forces screen), change to it in a
  fight for 1 AP (class, maneuvers, attack damage and range); finishers later
- Training Grounds reads its tier only while functional (sited, not overrun)
- Martials now keep carried expedition HP (the removed HP line reset it)
- Save assert for the carried weapon

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RF7HNp6pvyXiAz229q52Px
